       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. OSVSARTH.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-PREMIUM          PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
       01  WS-DISCOUNT         PIC SV999 COMP-3.
       01  WS-NET              PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
       01  WS-LOADED           PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
       01  WS-RECIPROCAL       PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       CALC-PARA.
           COMPUTE WS-NET = WS-PREMIUM * (1 - WS-DISCOUNT)
           COMPUTE WS-LOADED = (1 + WS-DISCOUNT) * WS-PREMIUM
           COMPUTE WS-RECIPROCAL = WS-PREMIUM * (2 - WS-DISCOUNT).
